== Available forms ==

These [[polymorph]]s merge [[item property|properties]] from any [[shield]] in the [[off-hand slot]] and the [[item]]s in the
[[armor slot|armor]] and
[[helmet slot]]s.
The drider, epic drider, and epic manticore also merge properties from items in the
[[amulet slot|amulet]],
[[belt slot|belt]],
[[boots slot|boots]],
[[cloak slot|cloak]], and 
[[first ring slot|ri]][[second ring slot|ng]] slots.
Whether or not the merged properties [[stack]] depends on whether or not those properties would stack when placed on the same item. Typically, this means that only [[regeneration]] will stack.
In addition, the drider and epic drider forms merge properties from any weapon in the [[main hand slot]]; these stack with the other properties if they would normally stack when placed on different items.

As with many polymorphs, these shapes can override the character's [[strength]], [[dexterity]], and [[constitution]], as well as provide [[temporary hit point]]s, a new [[armor class]], and weapons. There are three shapes available through this feat, and they improve to epic versions at shifter level 15.
